==========================================================================
PART F.  BOUNDARY/WIDE OVERLAP + consec far-family (NO GAP at span~16) [VERIFY]
==========================================================================
The partition {bounded span<=14 (finite check) | wide span>14 (this angle)}
has NO gap: at span ~ 15..16 BOTH the finite check (margin>=0.078) and the
wide decorr bound (margin>=0.149) apply.  We confirm the consec far-singleton
family p0(consec_{k-1} U {g}) stays below cap for ALL g, peaking at g=k-1
(= consec_k, INSIDE the finite check) then dropping to the plateau.

